    "name": "commit tag identity is wired but not verified",
    "evidence": "The TB declares and connects commit_tag_o/commit_tag_t, but has zero golden comparisons for either signal. The SVA interface has no commit_tag input, and ap_commit_header_hold omits tag. Context and slice index the Acc24 scoreboard, while terminal is structurally asserted; tag alone remains unchecked both on acceptance and across commit stalls.",
